    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="📱💻-scrcpy-无线投屏-·-安装与使用全攻略"><a href="#📱💻-scrcpy-无线投屏-·-安装与使用全攻略" class="headerlink" title="📱💻 scrcpy 无线投屏 · 安装与使用全攻略"></a>📱💻 scrcpy 无线投屏 · 安装与使用全攻略</h1><blockquote><p>🔒 <strong>隐私安全版</strong>：文中所有内网 IP、设备信息均已替换为示例值，可直接分享。<br>标注 ⚠️ 的地方，记得换成你自己的实际信息。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="🗂️-目录"><a href="#🗂️-目录" class="headerlink" title="🗂️ 目录"></a>🗂️ 目录</h2><div class="md-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th align="center">#</th><th>章节</th><th>内容</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center">1️⃣</td><td><a href="#1-%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C">准备工作</a></td><td>软硬件要求 · 网络环境</td></tr><tr><td align="center">2️⃣</td><td><a href="#2-%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%A3%E5%8E%8B">下载与解压</a></td><td>官方下载 · 目录结构</td></tr><tr><td align="center">3️⃣</td><td><a href="#3-%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E7%AB%AF%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE">手机端设置</a></td><td>开发者模式 · 无线调试 · 固定 IP</td></tr><tr><td align="center">4️⃣</td><td><a href="#4-%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%BF%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B">无线连接流程</a></td><td>配对 → 连接 → 投屏</td></tr><tr><td align="center">5️⃣</td><td><a href="#5-%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3">常见报错与解决</a></td><td>4 个高频坑全收录</td></tr><tr><td align="center">6️⃣</td><td><a href="#6-%E4%B8%80%E9%94%AE%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC">一键启动脚本</a></td><td>双击即投屏</td></tr><tr><td align="center">7️⃣</td><td><a href="#7-%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%A3%E8%B7%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E5%BA%94%E5%AF%B9">端口跳动原理</a></td><td>为什么会变 · 如何应对</td></tr><tr><td align="center">8️⃣</td><td><a href="#8-%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5">日常使用速查</a></td><td>命令 · 参数表</td></tr><tr><td align="center">9️⃣</td><td><a href="#9-%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96">可选优化</a></td><td>开机自启 · 图形界面版</td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr><h2 id="📌-隐私信息替换表"><a href="#📌-隐私信息替换表" class="headerlink" title="📌 隐私信息替换表"></a>📌 隐私信息替换表</h2><blockquote><p>⚠️ 下表中的示例值，请替换为你自己的真实信息：</p></blockquote><div class="md-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>文中示例值</th><th>你的实际值在哪看</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>📱 手机 IP</td><td><code>192.168.1.100</code></td><td>手机「无线调试」页面</td></tr><tr><td>🖥️ 电脑 IP</td><td><code>192.168.1.101</code></td><td>电脑 <code>ipconfig</code></td></tr><tr><td>🌐 路由器网关</td><td><code>192.168.1.1</code></td><td>电脑 <code>ipconfig</code> 的 Default Gateway</td></tr><tr><td>📶 局域网网段</td><td><code>192.168.1.x</code></td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>📲 手机型号</td><td><code>XX 手机（Android 13）</code></td><td>设置 → 关于手机</td></tr><tr><td>🔑 设备序列号</td><td><code>adb-XXXXXXXXXXXX-XXXX</code></td><td><code>adb devices</code> 输出</td></tr><tr><td>🔢 配对码</td><td><code>123456</code></td><td>手机配对页面（6 位）</td></tr><tr><td>🔌 连接端口</td><td><code>4xxxx</code></td><td>手机「无线调试」主页面</td></tr><tr><td>📂 解压目录</td><td><code>你的目录\scrcpy-win64-v4.1</code></td><td>你解压的位置</td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr><h2 id="1️⃣-准备工作"><a href="#1️⃣-准备工作" class="headerlink" title="1️⃣ 准备工作"></a>1️⃣ 准备工作</h2><div class="md-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>🏷️ 项目</th><th>✅ 要求</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>🖥️ 电脑</td><td>Windows 10 / 11 · 64 位</td></tr><tr><td>📱 手机</td><td>Android 11+（无线调试）/ Android 10 以下（USB 引导）</td></tr><tr><td>🌐 网络</td><td>手机与电脑连接<strong>同一个路由器 / WiFi</strong>（关键！）</td></tr><tr><td>🚫 Root</td><td>全程无需 Root、无需在手机安装任何 App</td></tr></tbody></table></div><blockquote><p>[!IMPORTANT]<br>🌟 手机与电脑必须处于<strong>同一局域网</strong>。例如电脑 IP 为 <code>192.168.1.101</code>，手机 IP 必须在 <code>192.168.1.x</code> 网段。<br>⚠️ 公司 WiFi / 访客网络常有 <strong>AP 隔离</strong>，设备互相不可见 —— 建议用家用路由器或手机热点先验证。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="2️⃣-下载与解压"><a href="#2️⃣-下载与解压" class="headerlink" title="2️⃣ 下载与解压"></a>2️⃣ 下载与解压</h2><h3 id="📦-2-1-下载官方压缩包"><a href="#📦-2-1-下载官方压缩包" class="headerlink" title="📦 2.1 下载官方压缩包"></a>📦 2.1 下载官方压缩包</h3><p>打开 <a href="https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/releases/latest">scrcpy 最新发布页</a>，下载：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">scrcpy-win64-v4.1.zip   ✅ 64 位系统选这个</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><blockquote><p>🚨 <strong>只从官方 GitHub 仓库下载</strong>，不要从第三方网站下载，谨防捆绑恶意软件。</p></blockquote><h3 id="📂-2-2-解压（绿色软件-·-免安装）"><a href="#📂-2-2-解压（绿色软件-·-免安装）" class="headerlink" title="📂 2.2 解压（绿色软件 · 免安装）"></a>📂 2.2 解压（绿色软件 · 免安装）</h3><p>解压到任意目录（如 <code>你的目录\scrcpy-win64-v4.1</code>），关键文件：</p><div class="md-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>📁 文件</th><th>📝 作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>adb.exe</code></td><td>Android 调试桥，<strong>已内置</strong>，无需单独安装</td></tr><tr><td><code>scrcpy.exe</code></td><td>主程序</td></tr><tr><td><code>scrcpy-server</code></td><td>推送到手机的服务端</td></tr><tr><td><code>open_a_terminal_here.bat</code></td><td>一键打开终端</td></tr></tbody></table></div><blockquote><p>💡 解压版最干净、无残留。命令行方式（WinGet / Chocolatey / Scoop）也可以，但新手不推荐。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="3️⃣-手机端设置"><a href="#3️⃣-手机端设置" class="headerlink" title="3️⃣ 手机端设置"></a>3️⃣ 手机端设置</h2><h3 id="🛠️-3-1-开启「开发者选项」"><a href="#🛠️-3-1-开启「开发者选项」" class="headerlink" title="🛠️ 3.1 开启「开发者选项」"></a>🛠️ 3.1 开启「开发者选项」</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">设置 → 关于手机 → 版本信息 → 连续点击「软件版本号」7 次 → 提示已进入开发者模式</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3 id="⚙️-3-2-开启「USB-调试」与「无线调试」"><a href="#⚙️-3-2-开启「USB-调试」与「无线调试」" class="headerlink" title="⚙️ 3.2 开启「USB 调试」与「无线调试」"></a>⚙️ 3.2 开启「USB 调试」与「无线调试」</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">设置 → 开发者选项 →</span><br><span class="line">  ✅ 打开 USB 调试</span><br><span class="line">  ✅ 打开 无线调试</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>开启「无线调试」后页面会显示：</p><ul><li>📡 <strong>IP 地址和端口</strong>（例：<code>192.168.1.100:4xxxx</code>）← 连接用</li><li>🔢 「使用配对码配对设备」← 点它获取<strong>配对端口 + 6 位配对码</strong></li></ul><h3 id="🔒-3-3-固定手机-IP（强烈建议-💪）"><a href="#🔒-3-3-固定手机-IP（强烈建议-💪）" class="headerlink" title="🔒 3.3 固定手机 IP（强烈建议 💪）"></a>🔒 3.3 固定手机 IP（强烈建议 💪）</h3><p>投屏依赖手机 IP，若 IP 经常变化会很麻烦，建议固定为 <code>192.168.1.100</code>：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">设置 → WLAN → 点击已连接 WiFi 的 ⓘ → 更多设置 → IP设置 → 选「静态」</span><br><span class="line">→ IP 地址填：192.168.1.100</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><blockquote><p>🏆 更稳妥的做法：浏览器打开 <code>192.168.1.1</code> 进路由器 → DHCP 设置 → <strong>静态地址保留 / IP 与 MAC 绑定</strong>。<br>手机 MAC 查看：<code>设置 → 关于手机 → 状态信息 → WLAN MAC 地址</code>。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="4️⃣-无线连接流程"><a href="#4️⃣-无线连接流程" class="headerlink" title="4️⃣ 无线连接流程"></a>4️⃣ 无线连接流程</h2><h3 id="💻-4-1-在-scrcpy-目录打开终端"><a href="#💻-4-1-在-scrcpy-目录打开终端" class="headerlink" title="💻 4.1 在 scrcpy 目录打开终端"></a>💻 4.1 在 scrcpy 目录打开终端</h3><p>在 <code>scrcpy-win64-v4.1</code> 文件夹<strong>地址栏输入 <code>cmd</code> 回车</strong>，或双击 <code>open_a_terminal_here.bat</code>。</p><blockquote><p>[!TIP]<br>💡 PowerShell 中运行本目录程序需要 <code>.\</code> 前缀：<code>.\adb</code>、<code>.\scrcpy</code>。</p></blockquote><h3 id="🔗-4-2-配对（只需成功一次）"><a href="#🔗-4-2-配对（只需成功一次）" class="headerlink" title="🔗 4.2 配对（只需成功一次）"></a>🔗 4.2 配对（只需成功一次）</h3><p>手机「无线调试」页面点「<strong>使用配对码配对设备</strong>」，会显示配对端口和 6 位码，电脑执行：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.\adb pair <span class="number">192.168</span>.<span class="number">1.100</span>:<span class="number">3</span>xxxx</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 提示 Enter pairing code: 时输入 6 位配对码（如 123456）</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">Enter pairing code: 123456</span><br><span class="line">Successfully paired to 192.168.1.100:3xxxx [guid=adb-XXXXXXXXXXXX-XXXX]</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>✅ 看到 <code>Successfully paired</code> 即为配对成功（手机端会显示配对电脑名称）。</p><blockquote><p>[!WARNING]<br>⏰ 配对码有效期很短，输入要快；失败就重新点「使用配对码配对设备」。<br>🔑 <strong>配对端口 ≠ 连接端口</strong>，千万别混用！</p></blockquote><h3 id="🔌-4-3-连接（每次投屏前执行）"><a href="#🔌-4-3-连接（每次投屏前执行）" class="headerlink" title="🔌 4.3 连接（每次投屏前执行）"></a>🔌 4.3 连接（每次投屏前执行）</h3><p>回到「无线调试」主页面看「<strong>IP 地址和端口</strong>」（通常是新端口），执行：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.\adb connect <span class="number">192.168</span>.<span class="number">1.100</span>:<span class="number">4</span>xxxx</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">connected to 192.168.1.100:4xxxx</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>✅ 看到 <code>connected to</code> 即成功，可验证：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.\adb devices</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">List of devices attached</span><br><span class="line">192.168.1.100:4xxxx      device        ← 状态必须是 device，不能是 offline / unauthorized</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3 id="🎬-4-4-启动投屏"><a href="#🎬-4-4-启动投屏" class="headerlink" title="🎬 4.4 启动投屏"></a>🎬 4.4 启动投屏</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.\scrcpy</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>成功输出类似：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">INFO: ADB device found:</span><br><span class="line">INFO:     --&gt; (tcpip)  192.168.1.100:4xxxx              device  你的手机型号</span><br><span class="line">[server] INFO: Device: [XX] XX手机 (Android 13)</span><br><span class="line">INFO: Renderer: direct3d11</span><br><span class="line">INFO: Texture: 720x1600</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>📲 手机屏幕画面出现在电脑窗口 → <strong>投屏成功！</strong> 🎉</p><hr><h2 id="5️⃣-常见报错与解决"><a href="#5️⃣-常见报错与解决" class="headerlink" title="5️⃣ 常见报错与解决"></a>5️⃣ 常见报错与解决</h2><h3 id="❌-报错-1：Could-not-find-any-ADB-device"><a href="#❌-报错-1：Could-not-find-any-ADB-device" class="headerlink" title="❌ 报错 1：Could not find any ADB device"></a>❌ 报错 1：<code>Could not find any ADB device</code></h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ERROR: Could not find any ADB device</span><br><span class="line">ERROR: Server connection failed</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><ul><li><strong>原因</strong> 🔍：直接运行 <code>scrcpy</code> 但还没 <code>adb connect</code> —— <strong>scrcpy 不会自动发现无线设备</strong>。</li><li><strong>解决</strong> ✅：先 <code>adb pair</code> → <code>adb connect</code> → 确认 <code>adb devices</code> 有 <code>device</code>，再运行 <code>scrcpy</code>。</li></ul><hr><h3 id="❌-报错-2：protocol-fault-couldn-t-read-status-message"><a href="#❌-报错-2：protocol-fault-couldn-t-read-status-message" class="headerlink" title="❌ 报错 2：protocol fault (couldn't read status message)"></a>❌ 报错 2：<code>protocol fault (couldn't read status message)</code></h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.\adb pair 192.168.1.100:3xxxx</span><br><span class="line">Enter pairing code: 123456</span><br><span class="line">error: protocol fault (couldn't read status message): No error</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><ul><li><strong>原因</strong> 🔍：配对端口已过期/失效（手机端重新生成了配对端口）。</li><li><strong>解决</strong> ✅：手机上重新点「使用配对码配对设备」，用<strong>新配对端口</strong>重新 <code>adb pair</code>。</li></ul><hr><h3 id="❌-报错-3：Multiple-2-ADB-devices"><a href="#❌-报错-3：Multiple-2-ADB-devices" class="headerlink" title="❌ 报错 3：Multiple (2) ADB devices"></a>❌ 报错 3：<code>Multiple (2) ADB devices</code></h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ERROR: Multiple (2) ADB devices:</span><br><span class="line">ERROR:     --&gt; (tcpip)  192.168.1.100:4xxxx              device  你的手机型号</span><br><span class="line">ERROR:     --&gt; (tcpip)  adb-XXXXXXXXXXXX-XXXX._adb-tls-connect._tcp            device  你的手机型号</span><br><span class="line">ERROR: Select a device via -s (--serial), -d (--select-usb) or -e (--select-tcpip)</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><ul><li><strong>原因</strong> 🔍：配对后 ADB 自动注册了一个 mDNS 服务条目，和 connect 的条目并存，出现两个设备（其实是同一台手机）。</li><li><strong>解决</strong> ✅ 二选一：</li></ul><p><strong>方案 A：指定设备启动</strong></p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.\scrcpy <span class="literal">-s</span> <span class="number">192.168</span>.<span class="number">1.100</span>:<span class="number">4</span>xxxx</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><strong>方案 B：清理多余条目</strong></p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.\adb disconnect adb<span class="literal">-XXXXXXXXXXXX-XXXX</span>._adb<span class="literal">-tls-connect</span>._tcp</span><br><span class="line">.\adb devices</span><br><span class="line">.\scrcpy</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><hr><h3 id="❌-报错-4：state-offline"><a href="#❌-报错-4：state-offline" class="headerlink" title="❌ 报错 4：state=offline"></a>❌ 报错 4：<code>state=offline</code></h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">List of devices attached</span><br><span class="line">192.168.1.100:4xxxx      offline</span><br><span class="line">ERROR: Device could not be connected (state=offline)</span><br><span class="line">ERROR: Server connection failed</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><ul><li><strong>原因</strong> 🔍：ADB 服务端存在陈旧连接状态（常见于手机重启、重新开关无线调试后）。</li><li><strong>解决</strong> ✅：重启 ADB 服务再连接：</li></ul><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.\adb <span class="built_in">kill</span><span class="literal">-server</span></span><br><span class="line">.\adb connect <span class="number">192.168</span>.<span class="number">1.100</span>:<span class="number">4</span>xxxx</span><br><span class="line">.\adb devices</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><blockquote><p>💡 若仍 <code>offline</code>：手机<strong>关掉再打开「无线调试」</strong> → 用新端口重新连接（必要时重新配对）。</p></blockquote><hr><h3 id="⚠️-其他注意点"><a href="#⚠️-其他注意点" class="headerlink" title="⚠️ 其他注意点"></a>⚠️ 其他注意点</h3><div class="md-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>🚦 现象</th><th>🛠️ 处理</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>unauthorized</code></td><td>手机弹窗「允许 USB 调试」→ 点允许</td></tr><tr><td>连接超时</td><td>确认同一 WiFi · 路由器无 AP 隔离</td></tr><tr><td>第一次启动弹防火墙</td><td>点「允许访问」（专用网络）</td></tr><tr><td>手机连不上</td><td>用手机热点可快速排除网络隔离问题</td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr><h2 id="6️⃣-一键启动脚本"><a href="#6️⃣-一键启动脚本" class="headerlink" title="6️⃣ 一键启动脚本"></a>6️⃣ 一键启动脚本</h2><blockquote><p>在 scrcpy 目录创建 <strong><code>start-scrcpy.bat</code></strong>，以后双击即投屏 ✨：</p></blockquote><figure class="highlight bat"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">@<span class="built_in">echo</span> off</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">chcp</span> <span class="number">65001</span> &gt;<span class="built_in">nul</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> /d %~dp0</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">rem ====== 手机 IP（已固定，一般不用改） ======</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">set</span> PHONE_IP=<span class="number">192</span>.<span class="number">168</span>.<span class="number">1</span>.<span class="number">100</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">rem 自动发现失败时的兜底端口（可在手机「无线调试」页面查看）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">set</span> DEFAULT_PORT=<span class="number">4</span>xxxx</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> [<span class="number">1</span>/<span class="number">5</span>] 重启 ADB 服务...</span><br><span class="line">adb kill-server &gt;<span class="built_in">nul</span> <span class="number">2</span>&gt;&amp;<span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">adb <span class="built_in">start</span>-server &gt;<span class="built_in">nul</span> <span class="number">2</span>&gt;&amp;<span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> [<span class="number">2</span>/<span class="number">5</span>] 自动查找手机当前端口...</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">set</span> PHONE_PORT=</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> /f "tokens=<span class="number">2</span>" <span class="variable">%%a</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> ('adb mdns services <span class="number">2</span>^&gt;<span class="built_in">nul</span> ^| <span class="built_in">findstr</span> "_adb-tls-connect._tcp"') <span class="keyword">do</span> (</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">set</span> PHONE_PORT=<span class="variable">%%a</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> "<span class="variable">%PHONE_PORT%</span>"=="" (</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">echo</span>     未找到动态端口，使用默认端口 <span class="variable">%DEFAULT_PORT%</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">set</span> PHONE_PORT=<span class="variable">%DEFAULT_PORT%</span></span><br><span class="line">) <span class="keyword">else</span> (</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">echo</span>     发现端口 <span class="variable">%PHONE_PORT%</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">set</span> DEVICE=<span class="variable">%PHONE_IP%</span>:<span class="variable">%PHONE_PORT%</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span>     使用设备 <span class="variable">%DEVICE%</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> [<span class="number">3</span>/<span class="number">5</span>] 连接手机...</span><br><span class="line">adb disconnect <span class="variable">%DEVICE%</span> &gt;<span class="built_in">nul</span> <span class="number">2</span>&gt;&amp;<span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">adb connect <span class="variable">%DEVICE%</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> [<span class="number">4</span>/<span class="number">5</span>] 等待设备上线（最多重试 <span class="number">15</span> 次）...</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">set</span> /a TRY=<span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">:check</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">set</span> /a TRY+=<span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="variable">%TRY%</span> <span class="keyword">gtr</span> <span class="number">15</span> <span class="keyword">goto</span> fail</span><br><span class="line">adb devices | <span class="built_in">findstr</span> "<span class="variable">%PHONE_IP%</span>:" | <span class="built_in">findstr</span> /v "offline" &gt;<span class="built_in">nul</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="keyword">errorlevel</span> <span class="number">1</span> (</span><br><span class="line">    adb reconnect &gt;<span class="built_in">nul</span> <span class="number">2</span>&gt;&amp;<span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    timeout /t <span class="number">2</span> /nobreak &gt;<span class="built_in">nul</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">goto</span> check</span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span>     设备已上线:</span><br><span class="line">adb devices</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">goto</span> run</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">:fail</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span>.</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> 连接失败：设备未上线（offline 或不存在）</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> 请确认手机已开启「无线调试」，且与电脑在同一 WiFi</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> 若端口已变，可手动修改本脚本第 <span class="number">8</span> 行的 DEFAULT_PORT</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">pause</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">exit</span> /b <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">:run</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> [<span class="number">5</span>/<span class="number">5</span>] 启动投屏（保持手机屏幕常亮）...</span><br><span class="line">scrcpy -s <span class="variable">%DEVICE%</span> --stay-awake</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">pause</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3 id="🌟-脚本能力一览"><a href="#🌟-脚本能力一览" class="headerlink" title="🌟 脚本能力一览"></a>🌟 脚本能力一览</h3><div class="md-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>🏷️ 能力</th><th>📝 说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>🚀 一键投屏</td><td>双击即连接 + 启动，无需手动敲命令</td></tr><tr><td>🔄 自动恢复</td><td>自动 <code>kill-server</code> 重启 ADB，消除 offline 残留</td></tr><tr><td>🔎 自动发现端口</td><td>通过 <code>adb mdns services</code> 读取手机当前端口，端口变了也不用改</td></tr><tr><td>🛡️ 兜底端口</td><td>自动发现失败时使用 <code>DEFAULT_PORT</code></td></tr><tr><td>⏳ 上线重试</td><td>每 2 秒检测一次，最多 30 秒</td></tr><tr><td>💡 屏幕常亮</td><td><code>--stay-awake</code> 投屏时手机不息屏</td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr><h2 id="7️⃣-端口跳动的原理与应对"><a href="#7️⃣-端口跳动的原理与应对" class="headerlink" title="7️⃣ 端口跳动的原理与应对"></a>7️⃣ 端口跳动的原理与应对</h2><p>「无线调试」的连接端口由系统<strong>每次开启时随机分配</strong>：</p><div class="md-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>⚡ 触发行为</th><th>🔄 影响</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>手机重启</td><td>端口变化</td></tr><tr><td>关闭再打开「无线调试」</td><td>端口变化</td></tr><tr><td>切换 WiFi</td><td>端口变化</td></tr><tr><td>保持「无线调试」一直开启</td><td>✅ 端口长期稳定</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>🛡️ 应对策略（双保险）：</strong></p><ol><li><strong>行为上</strong> 🧘：保持「无线调试」常开、不反复开关、不重启手机</li><li><strong>脚本上</strong> 🤖：<code>start-scrcpy.bat</code> 已支持<strong>自动发现端口</strong>，端口怎么变都自动适配</li></ol><blockquote><p>[!NOTE]<br>📌 若脚本自动发现失效（手机端提示未配对），重新 <code>adb pair</code> 配对一次即可，配对后可长期使用。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="8️⃣-日常使用速查"><a href="#8️⃣-日常使用速查" class="headerlink" title="8️⃣ 日常使用速查"></a>8️⃣ 日常使用速查</h2><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 🔗 配对（仅首次 / 提示未配对时）</span></span><br><span class="line">.\adb pair <span class="number">192.168</span>.<span class="number">1.100</span>:配对端口</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 输入 6 位码</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 🔌 连接</span></span><br><span class="line">.\adb connect <span class="number">192.168</span>.<span class="number">1.100</span>:连接端口</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 🔍 查看设备</span></span><br><span class="line">.\adb devices</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 🎬 启动投屏（指定设备 + 保持常亮）</span></span><br><span class="line">.\scrcpy <span class="literal">-s</span> <span class="number">192.168</span>.<span class="number">1.100</span>:连接端口 <span class="literal">--stay-awake</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ✨ 日常最简用法</span></span><br><span class="line">双击 <span class="built_in">start-scrcpy</span>.bat</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><strong>🎛️ 常用参数：</strong></p><div class="md-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>🏷️ 参数</th><th>📝 作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>--stay-awake</code></td><td>投屏时保持设备不休眠</td></tr><tr><td><code>--turn-screen-off</code></td><td>投屏时熄灭手机屏幕（省电）</td></tr><tr><td><code>--fullscreen</code></td><td>全屏显示</td></tr><tr><td><code>--max-fps=30</code></td><td>限制帧率，节省带宽</td></tr><tr><td><code>--no-audio</code></td><td>关闭音频</td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr><h2 id="9️⃣-可选优化"><a href="#9️⃣-可选优化" class="headerlink" title="9️⃣ 可选优化"></a>9️⃣ 可选优化</h2><h3 id="🚀-9-1-开机自启投屏"><a href="#🚀-9-1-开机自启投屏" class="headerlink" title="🚀 9.1 开机自启投屏"></a>🚀 9.1 开机自启投屏</h3><p>把 <code>start-scrcpy.bat</code> 的快捷方式放入开机启动文件夹：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">Win + R → 输入 shell:startup → 回车 → 放入快捷方式</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3 id="🎨-9-2-使用图形界面版-escrcpy（推荐尝鲜）"><a href="#🎨-9-2-使用图形界面版-escrcpy（推荐尝鲜）" class="headerlink" title="🎨 9.2 使用图形界面版 escrcpy（推荐尝鲜）"></a>🎨 9.2 使用图形界面版 escrcpy（推荐尝鲜）</h3><p>不想面对命令行？试试 <strong>escrcpy</strong>（基于 scrcpy 的 Electron 图形界面，更新活跃）：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">https://github.com/viarotel-org/escrcpy/releases/latest</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>界面提供可视化无线连接引导、多设备管理、参数记忆，体验更友好 🎉。</p><hr><h2 id="🏁-结语"><a href="#🏁-结语" class="headerlink" title="🏁 结语"></a>🏁 结语</h2><p>至此，你已拥有：<strong>固定 IP + 一键启动 + 自动发现端口 + 自动重试 + 屏幕常亮</strong> 的完整无线投屏方案 💪。</p><blockquote><p>🎯 <strong>核心口诀</strong>：同一 WiFi → 开无线调试 → 配对一次 → 双击脚本 → 投屏成功！🚀</p></blockquote>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
